### Merge PDF files
POST http://localhost:3232/merge
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PDFMergeBoundary

------PDFMergeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./tmp/1.pdf
------PDFMergeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./tmp/2.pdf
------PDFMergeBoundary--